                                "sense_id": "de60dbd7-534a-39b7-beb0-1f9a3cf05ac1",
                                "text": "Mona Bismarck took eighty-eight numbers in 1963, fairly typical except for the year when many of her clothes were in a train wreck and she ordered one hundred fifty Balenciagas all at once."
